@*
    jquery.validate + the unobtrusive adapter both depend on jQuery —
    must load jQuery first or both throw "$ is not defined" on every
    page that renders this partial. Local files (wwwroot/lib/) instead
    of CDN to match where the validate libs themselves come from.
    Closes TD-013; broader than the original framing because three
    views render this partial: Login (_AuthLayout), Receive +
    Putaway (_MobileLayout PWAs).
*@
<script src="~/lib/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js"></script>
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation/dist/jquery.validate.min.js"></script>
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation-unobtrusive/dist/jquery.validate.unobtrusive.min.js"></script>
